OL,3,GNEWSAInverclyde care home faces closure
OL,4,Aover 'serious risk' to residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Inverclyde is facing
OL,7,Fclosure after health inspectors found
OL,8,Fresidents were at serious risk.
OL,10,FEarlier inspections of Larkfield View
OL,11,FCare Centre by the Care Inspectorate
OL,12,Ffound significant concerns at the
OL,13,Fproperty, and an improvement notice was
OL,14,Fissued to owners Holmes Care.
OL,16,FHowever the watchdog has now said it
OL,17,Fhas found "evidence of serious risk to
OL,18,Fpeople experiencing care" at the home
OL,19,Fin Greenock, which has space for about
OL,20,F90 people.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
