OL,3,GNEWSAInverclyde care home faces closure
OL,4,Aover 'serious risk' to residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application to the sheriff court has
OL,7,Fbeen made, seeking cancellation of
OL,8,FHolmes Care's registration of the care
OL,9,Fhome. The company says it will
OL,10,F"vigorously challenge" the application.
